    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DUST DEVIL</h2>Super hardcore coffee-break arcade.<br><br><br>In the middle of street riots, you dodge motor officers, lasers, orbital beams and break cell mufflers on your hyper bike. The game is super fast and difficult: it has time limit and just a few checkpoints on your way to boss fights. With just one mouse button you control a swarm of bikers or a single agile rider. Your skills and tactics are that matters on each level.<br><br>No grind, no character progression, just never stopping action.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready, Steady, Go!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 minutes to (beat the game) overthrow the government<br></li><li>Minimalistic controls<br></li><li>14 levels from street riots to corporate rooftops<br></li><li>2 boss fights, no hitpoints<br></li><li>Drift and outmaneuver riot cops<br></li><li>Pick up duplicators to make bike swarms<br></li><li>Brutal New Game +</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DUST DEVIL</h2>Super hardcore coffee-break arcade.<br><br><br>In the middle of street riots, you dodge motor officers, lasers, orbital beams and break cell mufflers on your hyper bike. The game is super fast and difficult: it has time limit and just a few checkpoints on your way to boss fights. With just one mouse button you control a swarm of bikers or a single agile rider. Your skills and tactics are that matters on each level.<br><br>No grind, no character progression, just never stopping action.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready, Steady, Go!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 minutes to (beat the game) overthrow the government<br></li><li>Minimalistic controls<br></li><li>14 levels from street riots to corporate rooftops<br></li><li>2 boss fights, no hitpoints<br></li><li>Drift and outmaneuver riot cops<br></li><li>Pick up duplicators to make bike swarms<br></li><li>Brutal New Game +</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dust Devil is a coffee-break super hardcore minigame. With only one mouse button and your hyper bike you will overthrow a corrupt regime! Race from town squares to skyscraper rooftops in under 5 minutes. Help people on the streets and outspeed riot cops. Catch Prime Minister before he runs away!",
